{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### TP preset value lacks `+` sign causing display jump\n\n**Low Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\n`handleTpPresetClick` stores the preset as `String(percent)` (e.g., `\"10\"`), but `editingTpPercent` now uses `formatSignedRoePercent` which produces `\"+10\"` for positive values. When a user clicks a TP preset the field shows `\"10\"` (from `tpPresetPercent`), but after focusing and blurring the percent field, `tpPresetPercent` is cleared to `null` and the display falls through to `editingTpPercent` = `\"+10\"`, causing a visible value jump. SL presets don't have this issue because they use negative values which are consistent between `String(signedPercent)` and `formatSignedRoePercent`.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 7a3a1398-3534-4df9-af9e-f02ccf588189 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/components/app/perps/update-tpsl/update-tpsl-modal-content.tsx#L329-L332\nui/components/app/perps/update-tpsl/update-tpsl-modal-content.tsx#L69-L73\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/components/app/perps/update-tpsl/update-tpsl-modal-content.tsx#L69-L73`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/e54103d858e5aa9f4d26831af530a6fcbab83c78/ui/components/app/perps/update-tpsl/update-tpsl-modal-content.tsx#L69-L73)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..nqXtIj7b13yJKxS2Z0Qw4RNN9X8MoCkQkCv_gWuWZYeG07fozeX3DaO587coykeon4ZA3OH64K_zdWvdwmpUIhqqiz1uYTCt9eeTO9cigudWvn8SyLGxMbb_oEEG9YpLgfKFOon9AU5WDHu_zoS6W-DErPDC3BEGrpB53nDcQPaq9lHxYuG08B18upo984TA8JR9R_ZzLZZjvMiTO6S0B3SkANx-FCVX_LQac2b1rVLqj9j-9Y--qZS780amzZ0NbgUhOvqiMsYR8nKI3PKLFA7kRfMo8YhAqVjLQPnwulo0Z8CUI1K9pjWO0U5DAhzdgQChTpth4TUt3MG8566N3A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-sc